      "texts": [
        "Since umbrelOS 2.0, your Umbrel is served over HTTPS automatically on the local network, alongside plain HTTP. The certificate is created by the Umbrel itself and covers umbrel.local, your custom hostname and the local IP address, so browsers show a privacy warning until you install that certificate on your devices. It does not cover Tailscale addresses."
